Cazic Touch	21	{"kind":"spell","title":"Cazic Touch","wikiPath":"/Cazic_Touch","sources":[],"components":[],"rewards":[],"card":{"title":"Cazic Touch","icon":"https://eqlwiki.com/images/f/f2/Spellicon_C.png","lines":["Otherwise known as \"Death Touch\", this is an instant cast skill a number of high level Classic-era raid mobs have. As the nickname suggests, it is an unresistable instant kill with a 30 second cooldown that has to be managed by the raid. Pullers often act as sacrificial lambs for the ability, aggroing the mob and kiting them around until they get deathtouched so their tanks don't have to. Its namesake, Cazic Thule (God) was the first NPC with this ability. Several others in Plane of Sky were also given it, such as Keeper of Souls, Spiroc Lord, Sister of the Spire, and the sphinxes on island 7. No NPCs in Velious were given this ability, as the 32k HP hard-cap was lifted, providing sufficient challenge for players without it. Mobs that have this ability won't always open with it. More so, they have a high chance of using it each second while aggroed - I've seen mobs in Sky wait 20 seconds before DTing, but the average wait is usually 3-10 seconds.","Classes: This spell is cast by NPCs only.","Decrease Hitpoints by 25000","Mana: 0","Skill","Casting Time: 0.00","Recast Time: 0.00","Fizzle Time: 0.00","Resist: Unresistable","Range: 1000","Target Type: Single","Spell Type: Detrimental","Duration: Instant"]},"fetchedAt":"2026-09-05T03:40:22.533Z","outOfEra":false}
